{"v":4,"catch":"在全世界引起巨大轟動的永恆傑作終於來到了\nArcade Archives Series！","desc":"《PAC-MAN》是NAMCO於 1980 年推出的動作遊戲。\n一局把“豆子”都吃光就清楚了，才不會被四個不同性格的“幽靈”給抓到。\n如果吃了“能量球”，就可以反擊鬼魂，所以要在適當的時候用好它。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-09-24","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1662dfd152bffb089cf7d6dd92299b052ca3f4d3e692dcd22120a46c62898f29.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/42d5521e016fc742b16aee594d7fe344db65ad905c4a36cf9cab0cc506a6ac62.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ed4a4cf7fb766008884fc5917235847cf4ba97d7eef13720f3d092e292508ee6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3eb8501d090ddc281dabc15617b7dd1e43afe5aa08374b0329ba9b96cc7238d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/88eae91f957211aa2234e482a97ed7aa3a00833ecebd07ee4bb1f38ae9570c3a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e56ebcc2a145136de6a29ddee7d1dea69ce18de50f1506058f7b3f4e52758a4.jpg"],"titleId":"0100431015abe000","dlc":[]}